   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>Don\u2019t use this with Simple Season Selector. In 1.0.1 (coming eventually) I finally stripped off the rest of Sheepy\u2019s code, add an incompatibility for SSS, and (hopefully) figure out the best time in-game to randomly select a season.</p>\n\n        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->",
   "likes": 0
